  "description": "<p>Rothco's Reversible Reflective Rain Parka is designed to provide the ultimate rain protection and safety while out in the field. This rain jacket features 2 inch reflective striping around the chest, biceps, harness, lower waist, cuffs, and over the shoulders, ensuring high visibility in low-light conditions. The reversible style with storm/snap front offers full protection against the elements, while the pass-through pocket for audio devices, front zipper, and 5-button design adds convenience and durability. Additionally, the uniform raincoat includes a badge tab, making it an ideal choice for public safety and first responders. Whether you're working in wet weather or need high visibility for safety, this rain parka is built to meet your needs.</p>",
